# Every file in this port that carries a translatable string, plus every lib
# file that does not — so that a string added to one of them is extracted
# without anybody having to remember this list.
#
# Upstream has no POTFILES.in: it ships no po/ directory at all.
data/app.desktop
data/app.metainfo.xml
data/ui/shortcuts.ui
